  <h1>Exterior</h1>
  <p>Explore the third-generation S60 body, lighting, glazing, mirrors, wheels, paint, and exterior care. The overall body architecture is shared across the 2019–2024 generation, while grille details, bumpers, wheel designs, trim, lighting equipment, and sensors can vary by model year, trim, package, and market.</p>
