  <h2>What changes between S60 versions?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Momentum, R-Design and Inscription:</strong> exterior trim, grille treatment, bumpers, wheel designs and decorative details differ by trim and package.</li>
    <li><strong>Polestar Engineered:</strong> performance-specific exterior and chassis details; do not use a standard-trim photo to identify its parts.</li>
    <li><strong>Lighting and sensors:</strong> headlamp technology, active lighting, parking sensors, cameras and driver-support hardware depend on equipment.</li>
    <li><strong>Market and model year:</strong> badges, regulatory equipment and small trim details can differ even when the body shell is the same generation.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="note"><strong>Parts and paint:</strong> a photograph or trim badge is not a fitment check. Confirm the paint code, VIN, production date, sensor configuration, and exact part revision before ordering.</div>
